# The image takes the server's modules, their subfolders and data, and the
# notices: never tests, skills, venvs, compose files or local settings. A new
# subfolder the code reads gets its own line here.
*
!*.py
!formats
!requirements.txt
!ooxml
!data
!THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md
!licenses
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
